      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks... i tried the breathing thing but i still feel kinda woozy. i dont really have time to go to the doctor or anything right now, i have so much work to do. is there like a supplement or something i can take? maybe some magnesium or something to help my head settle so i can just focus?",
